Package: mica-tzdata
Version: 2026c-mica1
Source-Date-Epoch: 1790380800
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Mica OS <hi@micaos.dev>
Section: localization
Priority: optional
Provides: tzdata (= 2026c-0+deb13u1)
Conflicts: tzdata
Replaces: tzdata
Description: Time zones for Mica OS, as data
 /usr/share/zoneinfo of the pinned tzdata archive, carried as payload with no
 maintainer script: tzdata's own postinst parses a date with GNU date, which
 the floor does not have. It takes tzdata's place for anything that depends
 on it. /etc/localtime is not written, so the system stays on UTC until a
 product or the operator sets a zone.
